    <string name="summarizer_err_connect_timeout">The summarizer couldn\'t connect before the endpoint\'s Connection Timeout expired. The app will try again automatically. Check your connection or increase Connection Timeout for the selected endpoint.</string>
    <string name="summarizer_err_response_timeout_title">Response Timed Out</string>
    <string name="summarizer_err_response_timeout">The summarizer connected, but the model didn\'t respond before the endpoint\'s Response Time expired. The app will try again automatically. You can also choose another Summary Model or increase Response Time for the selected endpoint.</string>
